 and required skills.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filtering by single criterion works: Technology industry shows 3 jobs. Combined filtering works: Technology + Remote shows 1 job. Clear filters button restores full list of 9 jobs. All criteria (industry, location, employment type) filter individually and in combination.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Keyword search \\\"Python\\\" matches job titles (Senior Python Developer) and required skills (Data Analyst has Python skill). Returns 2 matching jobs with immediate result count update (\\\"Showing 2 jobs\\\"). Search is case-insensitive and updates results in real-time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Application submitted with name (Jane Smith), valid email (jane.smith@example.com), optional phone (555-1234), and message. Received success confirmation: \\\"Application submitted! Your application for Senior Python Developer at TechCorp Solutions has been sent.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-18\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit functionality found\", \"actual\": \"No edit buttons or links found on employer dashboard or job detail pages. Application does not provide ability to edit job details after posting. Feature appears not to be implemented.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Form validation prevents submission with missing required fields. Name field is required (empty = invalid). Email field rejects invalid format \\\"invalid-email\\\" with error \\\"Please include an '@'\\\". Message field is required (empty = invalid). HTML5 validation provides clear error messages for each invalid field.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid salary range accepted and published\", \"actual\": \"Job creation allowed with minimum salary (100000) greater than maximum salary (50000). Job displayed as \\\"$100k - $50k\\\" in both employer dashboard and job seeker listing. No validation error or clear feedback provided to employer about invalid salary range.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate applications accepted with same email\", \"actual\": \"Submitted second application for Senior Python Developer job using jane.smith@example.com (email already used for first application to same job). Application was accepted and success notification was shown. No validation prevented duplicate applications.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Application produced visible success confirmation. Application appears exactly once under Senior Python Developer job in employer dashboard with submitted information (name, email, phone, message, date).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filtered jobs by Healthcare industry. Results count updated immediately from \\\"Showing 9 jobs\\\" to \\\"Showing 1 jobs\\\" (only Registered Nurse job). Job list refreshed instantly without page reload. Clear filters button appeared. Demonstrates immediate refresh behavior.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Published job lost after page reload\", \"actual\": \"Before reload: 6 active jobs, 4 total applications, Senior Python Developer job visible in both job seeker and employer dashboard. After page reload: 5 active jobs, 3 total applications, Senior Python Developer job disappeared from both listings. Newly published jobs are not persisted across page reloads. Job deletion appears persistent, but job creation is not.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each job card displays: title (Senior Python Developer), company (TechCorp Solutions), industry (Technology), employment type (Full-time), location (Remote), salary range ($120k - $160k), posting date (Yesterday), and required skills (Python, Backend Development).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Job details page displays: title (Senior Python Developer), company (TechCorp Solutions), industry (Technology), employment type (Full-time), location (Remote), salary range ($120k - $160k), posting date (Posted Yesterday), full description, and required skills (Python, Backend Development).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Application details display name (Jane Smith), email (jane.smith@example.com), optional phone (555-1234), message (full text visible), and submission date (Yesterday) as a distinct record in employer dashboard.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Newly posted job (Senior Python Developer) displays \\\"Posted Yesterday\\\" which is accurate for job posted on 2026-08-24 (current date is 2026-08-25). Application submitted same day displays submission date \\\"Yesterday\\\" in employer dashboard. Date formatting is relative and accurate.\"}]}"
